        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><div><b>mgirman520 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>and the offical unlock tweet seems to say that low HP is needed<p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote></div><p>Unlocked at Wagner Mars Base, Visionary at&nbsp;16 HP with Foresight and Twist the Ether and a Mind Spike for the kill,&nbsp;&nbsp;Gloomy flipped with a bunch of cultists and zombies and relics out. So it seems that Visionary doesn't have to be bloodied.&nbsp;</p>",
