        "id": 144148,
        "name": "Jimeni",
        "username": "Jimeni",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/77aa72/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-10T09:38:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metlarcturus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/metlarcturus/48/2210_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metlarcturus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;mgirman520 wrote:</p>\n<blockquote>and the offical unlock tweet seems to say that low HP is needed&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nUnlocked at Wagner Mars Base, Visionary at&nbsp;16 HP with Foresight and Twist the Ether and a Mind Spike for the kill,&nbsp;&nbsp;Gloomy flipped with a bunch of cultists and zombies and relics out. So it seems that Visionary doesn't have to be bloodied.&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>yeah. I unlocked her with Visionary at 24 hp (thanks to Gramps Legacy/positive energy field, she ended at near full health despite climbing into her cocoon at near death).</p>\n<p>So maybe it's just: Visionary deals the killing blow to demon-God incarnate Gloomweaver on the same turn she breaks out of her cocoon.</p>",
