        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-10T12:28:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The conditions have been determined exactly, good work everyone here and in other forums!</p><p><strong>Defeat GloomWeaver on his “Demon-God Incarnate” side using The Visionary. Telekinetic Cocoon must have been destroyed at the start of The Visionary’s turn.</strong></p>",
