      {
        "id": 144151,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-10T12:59:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Here is my very slowly but guaranteed method of working:</p><p>Play with Visionary, Fanatic, and Absolute Zero against Gloomy, I was in Insula Primas but that doesn't.</p><p>Reroll until Visionary starts with Cocoon.....that's it.</p><p>Keep skipping turns, and let Fanatic and Absolute Zero die, you don't have to destroy or play anything.</p><p>Both Fanatic and Absolute Zero have incapped abilities that increase the next damage by 2.</p><p>Keep skipping turns until Gloomy flips, and Visionary can come out of the cocoon and destroy Gloomy in one hit.</p>",
