      {
        "id": 144152,
        "name": "cmschex",
        "username": "cmschex",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-10T13:01:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Here is my very slowly but guaranteed method of working:Play with Visionary, Fanatic, and Absolute Zero against Gloomy, I was in Insula Primas but that doesn't.Reroll until Visionary starts with Cocoon…that's it.Keep skipping turns, and let Fanatic and Absolute Zero die, you don't have to destroy or play anything.Both Fanatic and Absolute Zero have incapped abilities that increase the next damage by 2.Keep skipping turns until Gloomy flips, and Visionary can come out of the cocoon and destroy Gloomy in one hit.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>That seems a lot better than the 2 hour game I played that unlocked her last night (though I did unlock DW Nightmist in the same game so I suppose that was worth it)</p>",
