        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/benhimself/{size}/2160_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-10T13:23:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I love it when a plan comes together! Rook City Wraith sleuthed in the Ruins of Atlantis to find Pillars of Hercules, between all the extra villain plays from that and searching with Infrared Eyepiece, managed to flip Gloomweaver quickly. Plus the krakens are quite helpful at keeping Gloomy in check. So another voice chiming in for \"Visionary comes out of cocoon and kills flipped Gloomweaver\".</p>",
