        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The conditions have been determined exactly, good work everyone here and in other forums!<strong>Defeat GloomWeaver on his “Demon-God Incarnate” side using The Visionary. Telekinetic Cocoon must have been destroyed at the start of The Visionary’s turn.</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Okay, so I am now SUPER pissed off. &nbsp;I just spent another hour+ doing this. &nbsp;I had Visionary, Gloomy flipped, she was at 6 hp, and on the turn that she destroyed Telekinetic Cocoon, she used Maelstrom to kill him. &nbsp;NO UNLOCK! &nbsp;Android version, bug perhaps?</p>\n<p>Also, just to clarify, low HP is not (supposed to be) required?</p>",
