        "created_at": "2015-07-10T16:24:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"broccoli\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/48/1861_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> broccoli:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>MigrantP wrote:</b><br><blockquote>The conditions have been determined exactly, good work everyone here and in other forums!<strong>Defeat GloomWeaver on his “Demon-God Incarnate” side using The Visionary. Telekinetic Cocoon must have been destroyed at the start of The Visionary’s turn.</strong>\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nOkay, so I am now SUPER pissed off. &nbsp;I just spent another hour+ doing this. &nbsp;I had Visionary, Gloomy flipped, she was at 6 hp, and on the turn that she destroyed Telekinetic Cocoon, she used Maelstrom to kill him. &nbsp;NO UNLOCK! &nbsp;Android version, bug perhaps?Also, just to clarify, low HP is not (supposed to be) required?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I posted the exact requirements right there. It's nothing more, nothing less.</p>\n<p>If you did that and it didn't unlock, that would be a bug. If you can reproduce it, please send us screenshots of the sequence to <a href=\"mailto:feedback@handelabra.com\">feedback@handelabra.com</a>.</p>",
