        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>broccoli wrote:</b><br><blockquote>&nbsp;MigrantP wrote:<br><blockquote>The conditions have been determined exactly, good work everyone here and in other forums!<strong>Defeat GloomWeaver on his “Demon-God Incarnate” side using The Visionary. Telekinetic Cocoon must have been destroyed at the start of The Visionary’s turn.</strong>&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nOkay, so I am now SUPER pissed off. &nbsp;I just spent another hour+ doing this. &nbsp;I had Visionary, Gloomy flipped, she was at 6 hp, and on the turn that she destroyed Telekinetic Cocoon, she used Maelstrom to kill him. &nbsp;NO UNLOCK! &nbsp;Android version, bug perhaps?Also, just to clarify, low HP is not (supposed to be) required?\n</blockquote></div>\nI posted the exact requirements right there. It's nothing more, nothing less.If you did that and it didn't unlock, that would be a bug. If you can reproduce it, please send us screenshots of the sequence to <a href=\"mailto:feedback@handelabra.com\">feedback@handelabra.com</a>.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I did exactly that. &nbsp;The problem with screenshots is that it moves on to the end screen when you defeat him, so the best I could do is a screenshot before and a screenshot after. &nbsp;Honestly, I'm still pretty miffed about it, so I'm going to try Pydro's suggestion. &nbsp;I'll screenshot in case it doesn't work.</p>",
